{"data": [{"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:35:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115195793648812162"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/OracleCloud/st…", "end": 83, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/OracleCloud/status/2115121377187344641", "start": 60, "url": "https://t.co/7vFiRSX7dd"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/rHlGZ5LQG4", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2115195793648812162/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115195790612201472", "start": 84, "url": "https://t.co/rHlGZ5LQG4"}]}, "id": "2115195793648812162", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 7522, "like_count": 57, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115121377187344641", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "PoV of Jensen after reading TPUs are coming to Oracle Cloud\nhttps://t.co/7vFiRSX7dd https://t.co/rHlGZ5LQG4", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2115195793648812162"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-27T21:25:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115193271085637739"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/giotto_ai/stat…", "end": 97, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/giotto_ai/status/2115100162204856795", "start": 74, "url": "https://t.co/pNNw5N6iqK"}]}, "id": "2115193271085637739", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3075, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115100162204856795", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "People underestimate how much money is left to get thrown at sovereign ai https://t.co/pNNw5N6iqK", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2115193271085637739"}, {"author_id": "1529761561170124800", "created_at": "2026-10-27T20:57:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115186242459767006"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/zRfXsCm6yK", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2115186242459767006/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115186239494320128", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/zRfXsCm6yK"}]}, "id": "2115186242459767006", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 3577, "like_count": 70, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Since 2022, 72% of the world’s AI compute has ended up in the US and about 10% in China.\n\nAnd the US share keeps growing. It acquired around 60% of new compute each year from 2022 to 2024, then 72% in 2025, and 78% in the first half of 2026.\n\nThis data comes from our interactive https://t.co/zRfXsCm6yK", "url": "https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2115186242459767006"}, {"author_id": "1353836358901501952", "created_at": "2026-10-27T20:27:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115178675050307942"], "id": "2115178675050307942", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 667, "impression_count": 256267, "like_count": 2949, "quote_count": 164, "reply_count": 245, "retweet_count": 262}, "text": "Over the past few months, Anthropic scientists have engaged in deep research partnerships with six organizations developing new medicines. We've also begun drug discovery efforts of our own.\n\nIn doing so, we’ve learned much more about how Claude can support the many stages of", "url": "https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2115178675050307942"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-27T20:15:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115175550465507710"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/c9ycIUXAzD", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2115175550465507710/video/1", "media_key": "7_2115175434115571713", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/c9ycIUXAzD"}]}, "id": "2115175550465507710", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 48, "impression_count": 15731, "like_count": 123, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "Anthropic’s S-1 shows inference revenue per megawatt nearly quadrupling in a year.\n\n“Inference revenue per megawatt went from sixteen million last year to sixty plus currently, across the entire fleet. AI model businesses scale extremely well.”\n\n“Revenue grew 1,368% year over https://t.co/c9ycIUXAzD", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2115175550465507710"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-10-27T18:02:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115142112790397393"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ibrGg7peVM", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2115142112790397393/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115142110357696512", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/ibrGg7peVM"}]}, "id": "2115142112790397393", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 87, "impression_count": 7767, "like_count": 132, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "I think it's vastly underrated how important org chart and team functionality is to building a good LLM. Over 18 months old, and still one of my favorite all time Interconnects posts. It's why we still often see orgs crumble and need to get rebuilt (e.g. Llama/xAI) and why I https://t.co/ibrGg7peVM", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2115142112790397393"}, {"author_id": "12497", "created_at": "2026-10-27T17:07:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115128326922883517"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/benjedwards/st…", "end": 52, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/benjedwards/status/2115120640906727914", "start": 29, "url": "https://t.co/XBoG8gGkld"}]}, "id": "2115128326922883517", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9703, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 30, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115120640906727914", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "These ones are pretty great! https://t.co/XBoG8gGkld", "url": "https://x.com/simonw/status/2115128326922883517"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-10-27T17:01:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115126872455475476"], "entities": {"menti